     "object": "obj_mishnah_kelim",
     "kind": "tnan",
     "gloss_en": "ומי בטלה ליה מחשבה בהכי? והתנן: ... מחשבה אינה מוציאה לא מיד מעשה ולא מיד מחשבה",
     "against": "p_batla_machshavto",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_batla_machshavto",
     "gloss_en": "(proposed) the Rabbis hold that once he decided to roof with them, his first intent (food) is void"
